# Large local SoundFont test collection (~1.9 GB, untracked)
# Real-world SF2 corpus for local cross-checking (tools/sf2_crosscheck).
# Never committed: files are megabytes each and most carry sample-pack
# licensing that doesn't permit redistribution (planning document §10).
# Synthetic fixtures for the actual test suite live in libs/sf2/test/support.
testdata/

# Offscreen UI render + tuning-session scratch under outputs/ (the layout
# analysis scripts themselves are committed). The renders land in
# subdirectories, so ignore the whole tree rather than just the top level.
outputs/

# macOS custom-folder-icon marker files. Harmless on their own, but when a
# JUCE plugin target copies a resource tree that contains one, codesign
# rejects the bundle as carrying "detritus" and the build fails.
Icon?
